8. **`f1 f6 -`** - Difference between two features to capture relative impacts.
9. **`f3 f9 *`** - Product between features to express non-linear dependencies.
10. **`f7 f10 /`** - Division of two features to represent proportional relationships.

These additions bring a richer feature representation and allow models to pick up on more complex patterns in the data.
